   sections". Inside it, surface means this ground, so components that paint the page ground (line masks, node fills)
   match it. Raised panels and tables stay surface-raised and so stand out more, not less. */
.aq-section--alt { background: var(--surface-sunken); --surface: var(--surface-sunken); }
/* ---------- Plate: the frame a figure sits in inside a section (core.js wPlate) ----------
