/* PhoneKit sticky strip (860 and under, with script): the drawing held under the header at 180 px, full width of the
   column, the sheet fitted to the strip's height and panned and zoomed to the lit tag; the tags keep their 12 px size
   through the zoom (a counter-scale). The root stacks as a flex column (the strip first): a grid item's sticky box is
   held inside its own grid row, a flex item's inside the whole column, so the strip holds over every clause. */
.aq-clause-tabs[data-pk-on] { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: var(--space-4); }
.aq-clause-tabs[data-pk-on] .aq-clause-tabs__fig { order: -1; max-width: none; width: auto; margin: 0; }
