   top, values large and centred, a "Fits when" row and one action per plan underneath. Placeholders sit in a compact
   mono style so the grid still reads as a grid. A recommended plan (is-rec) is the table's one highlight: a flow-tint
   column with a 2 px flow line over its name and "Recommended" as a flow word above it. The baseline ("No plan",
   is-base) is quieter.
